            "text": "**Definition:** Numbers expressible as  $p/q$ , where  $p$  and  $q$  are integers and  $q \\neq 0$ ."
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "text": "**Decimal Nature:** Terminating or non-terminating repeating."
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "text": "**Examples:**  $-2/5$ , 0.2,  $7/3$ ."
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "text": "**Important Property:** Rational numbers have eventually repeating decimal expansions."
          }
